        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to turn the battlefield into your playground in <strong>TANKEGEDDON!</strong>, a toy-inspired tank shooter bursting with explosive action and charm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through 51<strong> thrilling levels</strong> spread across 5 unique areas, each brimming with enemy forces determined to send you to the scrapheap. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your tank to any colour you desire and make it truly your own before rolling into battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to triumph in the face of toy tank chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TACTICAL MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your strategic thinking to the test in this additional game mode. Here, every move counts, as enemies only move and fire when you do. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate carefully through 20 levels to find the right position to bring ultimate destruction to each of your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logic and precision are your ultimate weapons.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to turn the battlefield into your playground in <strong>TANKEGEDDON!</strong>, a toy-inspired tank shooter bursting with explosive action and charm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through 51<strong> thrilling levels</strong> spread across 5 unique areas, each brimming with enemy forces determined to send you to the scrapheap. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your tank to any colour you desire and make it truly your own before rolling into battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to triumph in the face of toy tank chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TACTICAL MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your strategic thinking to the test in this additional game mode. Here, every move counts, as enemies only move and fire when you do. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate carefully through 20 levels to find the right position to bring ultimate destruction to each of your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logic and precision are your ultimate weapons.</p>",
